WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.833
(rock band music)

00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:23.577
(crowd applauding)

00:00:23.577 --> 00:00:24.680
(light music)

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.450
- [Narrator] Garut in
Western Java, Indonesia,

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:27.851
is a quiet place.

00:00:27.851 --> 00:00:30.710
(children giggling)

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:33.022
Well, most of the time.

00:00:33.022 --> 00:00:35.855
(rock band music)

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:49.620
- [Narrator] Rebellion,
teenagers, rules and tradition.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.750
It's an age-old rock and roll story,

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:54.340
but this time, with hijabs.

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:57.553
Meet the VoB, Indonesia's Metal Hijabis.

00:00:57.553 --> 00:00:59.000
(girls laughing)

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.990
There's Firdda, the
vocalist and guitarist,

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.170
who loves hip-hop.

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:05.690
Ouidi, the drummer, a Red
Hot Chili Peppers aficionado.

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.120
Then you got C.T. on the bass,

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:08.530
who likes her thrash metal bands

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:10.493
like Lamb of God and System of a Down.

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:27.918
(rock band music)

00:01:42.881 --> 00:01:45.798
(metal band music)

00:02:02.767 --> 00:02:05.600
(rock band music)

00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:07.990
- [Narrator] Since its start in 2014,

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:11.303
the band has seen some success,
but not without its critics.

00:02:50.724 --> 00:02:53.557
(rock band music)

